Error [jet.DispatchHoleCount]: An `if` table header holds one `_` hole, and this one has 2
  --> Tests/UI/e0946_dispatch_hole_twice.jet:4:8
    |
  4 |     if n % _ == _ {
    |        ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Each arm's candidate takes the place of the one `_`, so a second `_` would stand for nothing
 Fix: Keep one `_` and write the other value out in the header
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0946
